// The SDK spawns the CLI with --input-format stream-json unconditionally, and
// the string-prompt path writes one user frame without calling endInput(), so
// stdin is still open while the turn runs. A user frame pushed into it is read
// at the next agent-loop boundary -- the same turn, no restart, no resume.
const kitSteerable = new WeakSet(); // runs whose stdin is still writable
